{"seq":3,"slug":"sustainable-agriculture","title":"可持续农业","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/agriculture/sustainable-agriculture","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"可持续农业-简介\">可持续农业 简介</h1><p>可持续农业是当代农业科学与发展研究中最具战略意义的方向之一，旨在探索既能满足当前粮食需求、又不损害后代资源利用能力的农业生产模式。这一领域横跨生态学、农学、经济学和政策科学，要求学习者具备跨学科的视野和系统思维能力。</p>\n<p>本课程围绕可持续农业的生态基础、资源管理、气候应对和制度保障四大主题展开，引导学习者从理论认知走向实践分析。</p>\n<p>第一章<strong>农业生态学</strong>从生态系统的视角审视农业活动，探讨农业生态系统所提供的各类服务功能、农田生物多样性的维持与促进机制，以及农林复合系统作为可持续土地利用模式的设计原理与实践经验。</p>\n<p>第二章<strong>资源管理</strong>聚焦农业生产中关键自然资源的高效利用与保护，涵盖灌溉与雨水管理策略、土壤质量的保育和退化防治，以及有害生物综合治理中生物、物理和化学手段的协调运用。</p>\n<p>第三章<strong>气候变化与农业适应</strong>分析全球气候变化对农业生产系统的深层影响及应对策略，包括气候智慧型农业的理念框架、农业碳汇与固碳的机制和潜力，以及抗旱作物育种与种质资源创新的最新进展。</p>\n<p>第四章<strong>农业可持续发展政策</strong>将视角从技术层面拓展至制度与治理，讨论农业政策分析的基本方法、乡村发展与农村振兴战略的路径选择，以及全球粮食安全体系面临的挑战与应对框架。</p>\n<p>建议学习者将生态学和农学基础知识作为出发点，依序深入各章内容。可持续农业的学习重在培养对复杂系统的整体把握能力，理论阅读应与实际案例分析相结合。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"agroecology","title":"农业生态学","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/agriculture/sustainable-agriculture/agroecology","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ecosystem-services-agriculture","title":"研究生 可持续农业 — 农业生态系统服务","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/agriculture/sustainable-agriculture/agroecology/ecosystem-services-agriculture"},{"seq":2,"slug":"biodiversity-farming","title":"研究生 可持续农业 — 农业生物多样性","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/agriculture/sustainable-agriculture/agroecology/biodiversity-farming"},{"seq":3,"slug":"agroforestry","title":"研究生 可持续农业 — 农林复合系统","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/agriculture/sustainable-agriculture/agroecology/agroforestry"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"resource-management","title":"资源管理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/agriculture/sustainable-agriculture/resource-management","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"water-management","title":"研究生 可持续农业 — 农业水资源管理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/agriculture/sustainable-agriculture/resource-management/water-management"},{"seq":2,"slug":"soil-conservation","title":"研究生 可持续农业 — 土壤保育","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/agriculture/sustainable-agriculture/resource-management/soil-conservation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"integrated-pest-management","title":"研究生 可持续农业 — 有害生物综合治理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/agriculture/sustainable-agriculture/resource-management/integrated-pest-management"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"climate-adaptation","title":"气候变化与农业适应","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/agriculture/sustainable-agriculture/climate-adaptation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"climate-smart-agriculture","title":"研究生 可持续农业 — 气候智慧型农业","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/agriculture/sustainable-agriculture/climate-adaptation/climate-smart-agriculture"},{"seq":2,"slug":"carbon-sequestration-farming","title":"研究生 可持续农业 — 农业碳汇与固碳","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/agriculture/sustainable-agriculture/climate-adaptation/carbon-sequestration-farming"},{"seq":3,"slug":"drought-resilient-crops","title":"研究生 可持续农业 — 抗旱作物育种与种质创新","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/agriculture/sustainable-agriculture/climate-adaptation/drought-resilient-crops"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"policy","title":"农业可持续发展政策","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/agriculture/sustainable-agriculture/policy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"agricultural-policy","title":"研究生 可持续农业 — 农业政策分析","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/agriculture/sustainable-agriculture/policy/agricultural-policy"},{"seq":2,"slug":"rural-development","title":"研究生 可持续农业 — 乡村发展与农村振兴","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/agriculture/sustainable-agriculture/policy/rural-development"},{"seq":3,"slug":"food-security-systems","title":"研究生 可持续农业 — 粮食安全体系","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/agriculture/sustainable-agriculture/policy/food-security-systems"}]}]}